"What the traveller experiences: getting to the terminal, waiting, the ride, and getting from the terminal to the destination. Flights are fast in the air but lose time at both ends.":"Yang dialami penumpang: menuju terminal, menunggu, perjalanan, dan dari terminal ke tujuan. Penerbangan cepat di udara tetapi kehilangan waktu di kedua ujung.",
